# [NTP](../wg/ntp.html)

## Summary

The NTP Working Group met for a virtual interim session to discuss active working group drafts, interoperability testing progress, coordination with external bodies (ITU and IEEE 1588), leap second updates, and time synchronization challenges in deep space. 

Key milestones include the publication of `draft-ietf-ntp-nts-for-ptp` and progress on NTPv5 (`draft-ietf-ntp-ntpv5`) design decisions. The group decided to handle outstanding NTPv5 issues via the mailing list rather than holding an additional virtual interim before IETF 121.

